# QueryCraft AI — Optional Environment Variables
# The application runs 100% offline using its local pattern engine without any API keys.
# To optionally enable arbitrary phrasing translation with an external LLM, supply an API key below:

# OpenAI API (Optional)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Google Gemini API (Optional)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash
